{"index":94,"nameArabic":"الشرح","ayahs":[{"index":1,"text":"أَلَمْ نَشْرَحْ لَكَ صَدْرَكَ","bismillah":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ","translation":"Have We not caused thy bosom to dilate"},{"index":2,"text":"وَوَضَعْنَا عَنكَ وِزْرَكَ","translation":"And eased thee of the burden"},{"index":3,"text":"ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنقَضَ ظَهْرَكَ","translation":"Which weighed down thy back"},{"index":4,"text":"وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ","translation":"And exalted thy fame"},{"index":5,"text":"فَإِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","translation":"But lo! with hardship goeth ease"},{"index":6,"text":"إِنَّ مَعَ ٱلْعُسْرِ يُسْرًا","translation":"Lo! with hardship goeth ease"},{"index":7,"text":"فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَٱنصَبْ","translation":"So when thou art relieved, still toil"},{"index":8,"text":"وَإِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَٱرْغَب","translation":"And strive to please thy Lord"}]}